    "group": "Medusa's Wrath",
    "summary": "When you choose one of your units with the Adeptus Astartes keyword to fight or shoot, apply its allowance during attack resolution. It gets up to one re-roll in each category, Hit, Wound and Damage, if a friendly unit with either Cannok Var or Iron Father Feirros is at most 6 inches away. Outside both ranges it may re-roll just one of those three rolls.",
